      "writtenOn": "2015-05-26T21:47:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, this includes the performance improvement by passing the filters directly to drivers.\n\nAlso, it puts the business logic (expanding inherited and group role assignments) at the correct level, i.e, the manager.\n\nOnce we have that logic at the manager level, it needs to have a way to represent expanded role assignments to the controller level, which is responsible for formatting the results.\n\nSo this formatting changes are implied by the refactoring being done here.",
      "parentUuid": "da9b358b_9904d415",
      "revId": "05655992679211869d348ebf0887766c6a13ad90",
